## History Recording (BLOCKING REQUIREMENT)
After completing ANY code work, you MUST write `.claude/histories/YYYY-MM-DD.md`:
- AI tool name + model name
- User request (original text)
- Tasks performed
- Features added (MOST IMPORTANT)
- Files changed
- Notes for next AI session
